<title>SPAIN: ENCE half year loss 2.29 bln ptas.</title>
<headline>ENCE half year loss 2.29 bln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish paper firm ENCE, which earlier announced a second quarter net loss of 1.343 billion pesetas, said its loss in the first half of the year was 2.29 billion, compared with a profit of 7.34 billion in the same period last year.</p>
<p>It had made a net loss of 947 million in the first quarter of the year.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2151</p>
